    "**an identity-erased operand is not judged by carrier selection** (an arithmetic operand whose authored type name reads empty -- its identity erased by inference -- makes v1.compiler.infer_types operand_identity_unknown abstain, so arithmetic_carrier_selection returns Absent and the operator keeps the left-operand typing it had before carrier selection existed: accepted, unjudged).",

